Italian activists challenge Israeli-linked solar projects






                Italian activists in a small Tuscan town have been protesting against a planned&nbsp;agrivoltaics park&nbsp;after tracing its ownership to Shikun &amp; Binui, an Israeli company with ties to&nbsp;Israel's military.&nbsp;

